doi: "TODO: mint a Zenodo DOI via https://zenodo.org/account/settings/github/"
url: "https://github.com/ichasekatz/sqs-benchmark"
abstract: >
  Statistical benchmark comparing three SQS generation methods — ATAT mcsqs,
  SCRAPS (cuckoo-search SRO optimizer), and random assignment — demonstrated for
  the equimolar BCC NbVW ternary system (48-atom 4×3×2 supercell), with MLIP
  relaxation and CALPHAD TDB fitting via BLADE. Parameterized for any
  BLADE-supported crystal prototype.
